<div class="page-header"><h1>导出中心 <small>---月度工作簿 / 列表数据（客户订单 / 六联单 / 出库单 / 价格）</small></h1></div>

<%# 各业务列表页的「导出 Excel」已集中到本页（列表页不再重复放按钮） %>
<div class="card mb-3">
  <div class="card-body py-2">
    <h6 class="mb-2">列表数据导出（全量）</h6>
    <div class="d-flex gap-2 align-items-center flex-wrap">
      <%= link_to "客户订单", orders_path(format: :xlsx), data: { turbo: false }, class: "btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" %>
      <%= link_to "客户", customers_path(format: :xlsx), data: { turbo: false }, class: "btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" %>
      <%= link_to "产品", items_path(format: :xlsx), data: { turbo: false }, class: "btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" %>
      <%= link_to "价格", prices_path(format: :xlsx), data: { turbo: false }, class: "btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" %>
      <span class="small text-muted">与各列表页数据同口径的全量导出</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%= form_tag monthly_export_path, method: :get, class: "card", data: { turbo: false } do %>
  <div class="card-body">
    <h6 class="mb-2">月度工作簿（按月）</h6>
    <div class="row g-2 align-items-end">
      <div class="col-auto">
        <label class="form-label small mb-0">月份</label>
        <input type="month" name="month" value="<%= @month.strftime('%Y-%m') %>" class="form-control form-control-sm" required>
      </div>
      <div class="col-auto">
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary">导出工作簿</button>
      </div>
      <div class="col-auto small text-muted">
        四表与现用 Excel 字段一一对应；六联单表含分配对（订单N/分配量N，来自分配台账）；价格表为现行生效价格 + 最新阶梯批次。
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
<% end %>

<div class="card">
  <div class="card-body py-2">
    <%= link_to "导出所有（全部时间段数据，不限月份）", export_all_path,
                class: "btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm", data: { turbo: false },
                title: "客户订单 / 六联单 / 出库单 按全时间导出；价格、阶梯、客户、产品照常全量" %>
  </div>
</div>
